flowchart TD
    Client([HTTP Client]) -->|POST /trade| API[FastAPI Orchestrator\n:8000]

    API --> Pipeline[TradingPipeline]
    API --> Auction[AuctionManager]
    API --> Scaler[DynamicScaler]

    Pipeline -->|trading.quotes.collect| NATS[(NATS\nBroker)]
    NATS -->|queue group| QA1[quotes-agent-1\nGo]
    NATS -->|queue group| QA2[quotes-agent-2\nGo]

    QA1 -->|trading.quotes.done| NATS
    QA2 -->|trading.quotes.done| NATS

    NATS -->|trading.quotes.done| Pipeline
    Pipeline -->|trading.market.analyze| NATS
    NATS --> MA[market-analyzer\nGo]
    MA -->|trading.market.done| NATS

    NATS -->|trading.market.done| Pipeline
    Pipeline -->|trading.risk.assess| NATS
    NATS --> RM[risk-manager\nGo]
    RM <-->|state| Redis[(Redis\n:6379)]
    RM -->|trading.risk.done| NATS

    NATS -->|trading.risk.done| Pipeline
    Pipeline -->|trading.trade.execute| NATS
    NATS --> TE[trade-executor\nGo]
    TE -->|trading.trade.done| NATS

    NATS -->|trading.trade.done| Pipeline
    Pipeline -->|trading.llm.analyze| NATS
    NATS --> LLM[llm-analyst\nPython+Gemini]
    LLM -->|trading.llm.done| NATS

    All[All agents] -->|traces| Jaeger[(Jaeger\n:16686)]

    Monitoring[Monitoring\n:8080] -->|HTTP| API

    Scaler -->|Docker API| Docker[(Docker\nEngine)]
